  <Docs>
    <summary>Marks an <c>android.test.InstrumentationTestCase</c> test method for re-execution when it fails.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>This annotation is deprecated. Use
            <see href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/support/test/filters/FlakyTest.html">
            FlakyTest</see> instead. New tests should be written using the
            <see href="https://developer.android.com/tools/testing-support-library/index.html">Android Testing Support Library</see>.</para>
